<p>You're going for weird and disgusting, but you also try to clearly implicate the fact that this is something that can seriously break the Masquerade because of how viral it is, urgent enough that our main character has to email the boss right away. So the fact that you only explore &quot;weird and disgusting&quot; when you clearly try to shoot for more is&#8230; really disappointing. So I can't see this tale as anything more than what you initially present it as.</p>
<p>So for that, -1.</p>

