			<div class="content" id="post-content-2298560">
									

<p>More like 100 feet of NOPE!</p>
<p>Seriously, this made me feel sick and disgusted, but not in a good way. Not in the horror kinda way, but in the just damn disgusting way, in the human-centipede-fucking-sickening way. -1.</p>
<p>E: I just prefer my horror to be in a creative, difficult-to-write way, not just the horrible imagery of 100 feet of rope being shoved down a throat.</p>

							</div>

										<div class="signature">
					<hr class="signature-separator"/>
					

<p>Smoke me a kipper, I'll be back for breakfast.</p>

				</div>
					
